---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

---
<Base title="How Pricing Works" description="Pricing is built around your use case and its complexity. Month-to-month plans, no setup fee for standard services, and usage billed at actual provider cost." current="pricing">
<section aria-labelledby="h1" style="padding:clamp(32px,4vw,48px) 0 clamp(48px,5.5vw,80px)">
<div style="max-width:1296px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 clamp(24px,4vw,48px)">
<nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:14px;margin-bottom:clamp(32px,5vw,64px)"><a href="/">Home</a><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:16px;color:#585E5A">chevron_right</span><span aria-current="page" style="color:#585E5A">Pricing</span></nav>
<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:24px;max-width:780px">
<p style="font-weight:600;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1D6B60">Pricing</p>
<h1 id="h1" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(34px,4vw,48px);line-height:1.15;letter-spacing:-0.025em">How pricing works</h1>
<p style="font-size:clamp(18px,1.6vw,20px);line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633;max-width:58ch">Pricing is built around your use case and its complexity. Plans are month-to-month, standard services have no setup fee, and usage is billed at actual provider cost.</p>
<p style="font-size:14px;color:#585E5A">Last updated October 2026</p>
</div>

<div style="margin-top:clamp(40px,6vw,64px);background:#fff;border:1px solid #DED5C6;border-radius:16px;padding:clamp(24px,3.5vw,40px);box-shadow:0 24px 64px rgba(15,76,69,.08)">
<p style="font-weight:600;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#585E5A;margin-bottom:24px">How your bill comes together</p>
<div class="bill-cols" style="display:grid;gap:16px;align-items:stretch">
<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;padding:24px;border-radius:12px;background:#0F4C45;color:#FAF7F2"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:28px;color:#D6A552">widgets</span><b style="font-size:19px;line-height:1.3">AI services</b><p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#DCE7E4">The paid component, priced for your use case. Month-to-month.</p></div>
<span aria-hidden="true" style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:28px;font-weight:600;color:#0F4C45">+</span>
<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;padding:24px;border-radius:12px;background:#E3EDE9"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:28px;color:#0F4C45">receipt_long</span><b style="font-size:19px;line-height:1.3">Usage at cost</b><p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#2F3633">Voice minutes, SMS and AI processing, billed at actual provider cost. No markup.</p></div>
<span aria-hidden="true" style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:28px;font-weight:600;color:#0F4C45">+</span>
<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;padding:24px;border-radius:12px;border:1.5px dashed #B9AE9C"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:28px;color:#585E5A">build</span><b style="font-size:19px;line-height:1.3">Setup fee, only if needed</b><p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#2F3633">None for standard services. Applies only when customization is required.</p></div>
</div>
<div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px 24px;margin-top:24px;padding-top:20px;border-top:1px solid #DED5C6;font-size:15px;color:#2F3633">
<span style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:20px;color:#0F4C45">redeem</span><span>Included: a <a href="/free-website-terms">free static website</a> with any AI service</span></span>
<span style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:20px;color:#0F4C45">request_quote</span>Quoted separately: custom work, as a fixed price</span>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section aria-labelledby="pay-h" style="background:#E8F2EE;padding:clamp(48px,5.5vw,80px) 0">
<div style="max-width:1296px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 clamp(24px,4vw,48px)">
<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:48px"><h2 id="pay-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(28px,3vw,36px);line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-0.02em">What you pay for</h2><p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633">You pay for the AI services you use. Everything else is either at cost or quoted up front.</p></div>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,260px),1fr));gap:24px">
<div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #DED5C6;border-radius:12px;padding:32px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px"><span style="width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:12px;background:#D5EDE3;color:#0F6B57;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:24px;color:#0F6B57">widgets</span></span><h3 style="font-weight:600;font-size:20px;line-height:1.3">AI services</h3><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633">AI services are the paid component, priced by use case and complexity.</p></div>
<div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #DED5C6;border-radius:12px;padding:32px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px"><span style="width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:12px;background:#DBE8F7;color:#2B5C8F;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:24px;color:#2B5C8F">receipt_long</span></span><h3 style="font-weight:600;font-size:20px;line-height:1.3">Usage, at cost</h3><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633">Voice minutes, text and WhatsApp messages, and AI processing are billed separately at actual provider cost, with no markup.</p></div>
<div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #DED5C6;border-radius:12px;padding:32px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px"><span style="width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:12px;background:#FBE0D6;color:#A23E1E;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:24px;color:#A23E1E">build</span></span><h3 style="font-weight:600;font-size:20px;line-height:1.3">Setup, only for customization</h3><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633">Standard services have no setup fee. A setup fee applies only when customization is required.</p></div>
<div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #DED5C6;border-radius:12px;padding:32px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px"><span style="width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:12px;background:#F8EACB;color:#8A5A00;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:24px;color:#8A5A00">request_quote</span></span><h3 style="font-weight:600;font-size:20px;line-height:1.3">Custom work, quoted separately</h3><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633">Custom websites and mobile apps, custom integrations and software, and self-hosted setups.</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section aria-labelledby="inc-h" style="padding:clamp(48px,5.5vw,80px) 0">
<div style="max-width:1296px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 clamp(24px,4vw,48px);display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,380px),1fr));gap:clamp(32px,5vw,64px);align-items:start">
<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px"><h2 id="inc-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(28px,3vw,36px);line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-0.02em">What's included</h2><p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633;max-width:44ch">With at least one AI service, you also get:</p></div>
<ul style="list-style:none;padding:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px">
<li style="display:flex;gap:20px;padding:28px;background:#fff;border:1.5px solid #0F4C45;border-radius:16px"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:32px;color:#0F4C45">redeem</span><div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px"><h3 style="font-weight:600;font-size:20px;line-height:1.3">A free static website</h3><ul style="list-style:none;padding:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;color:#2F3633"><li style="display:flex;gap:8px"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:20px;color:#0F4C45">check</span>Up to 5 pages</li><li style="display:flex;gap:8px"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:20px;color:#0F4C45">check</span>One revision round</li><li style="display:flex;gap:8px"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:20px;color:#0F4C45">check</span>Yours to keep if you leave</li></ul><a href="/free-website-terms" style="font-size:15px;font-weight:600">Free Website Terms apply</a></div></li>
<li style="display:flex;gap:20px;padding:28px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #DED5C6;border-radius:16px"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:32px;color:#5B3E9A">shield_lock</span><div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px"><h3 style="font-weight:600;font-size:20px;line-height:1.3">Managed infrastructure</h3><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633">Your own isolated environment, with monitoring, maintenance and updates included.</p></div></li>
<li style="display:flex;gap:20px;padding:28px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #DED5C6;border-radius:16px"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:32px;color:#0F4C45">key</span><div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px"><h3 style="font-weight:600;font-size:20px;line-height:1.3">Ownership</h3><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633">You own your domain, hosting, website content and data.</p></div></li>
</ul>
</div>
</section>

<section aria-labelledby="terms-h" style="background:#0F4C45;color:#FAF7F2;padding:clamp(48px,5.5vw,80px) 0">
<div style="max-width:1296px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 clamp(24px,4vw,48px)">
<h2 id="terms-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(28px,3vw,36px);line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin-bottom:48px">Terms</h2>
<ul style="list-style:none;padding:0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,280px),1fr));gap:24px">
<li style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;padding:32px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid rgba(250,247,242,.2);background:rgba(250,247,242,.04)"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:32px;color:#D6A552">event_repeat</span><b style="font-size:22px;line-height:1.3">Month-to-month</b><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#DCE7E4">No long-term contract.</p></li>
<li style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;padding:32px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid rgba(250,247,242,.2);background:rgba(250,247,242,.04)"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:32px;color:#D6A552">logout</span><b style="font-size:22px;line-height:1.3">30 days' notice to leave</b><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#DCE7E4">Give 30 days' written notice, and take a full data export within 90 days.</p></li>
<li style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;padding:32px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid rgba(250,247,242,.2);background:rgba(250,247,242,.04)"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:32px;color:#D6A552">notifications</span><b style="font-size:22px;line-height:1.3">30 days' notice on price changes</b><p style="font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#DCE7E4">You hear about any price change at least 30 days before it applies.</p></li>
</ul>
</div>
</section>

<section aria-labelledby="aff-h" style="padding:clamp(48px,5.5vw,80px) 0">
<div style="max-width:1296px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 clamp(24px,4vw,48px);display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,380px),1fr));gap:clamp(32px,5vw,64px);align-items:start">
<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px"><h2 id="aff-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(28px,3vw,36px);line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-0.02em">What affects your price</h2><p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633;max-width:44ch">We start with one right-sized solution, so your first quote covers only what you need now.</p></div>
<ol style="list-style:none;padding:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;border-top:1px solid #DED5C6">
<li style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:20px;padding:20px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #DED5C6"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:26px;color:#0F4C45">target</span><div><b style="font-size:18px">Use case</b><p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#585E5A">The problem you want to solve</p></div></li>
<li style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:20px;padding:20px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #DED5C6"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:26px;color:#0F4C45">account_tree</span><div><b style="font-size:18px">Complexity</b><p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#585E5A">How involved your workflows and rules are</p></div></li>
<li style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:20px;padding:20px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #DED5C6"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:26px;color:#0F4C45">stacks</span><div><b style="font-size:18px">Number of services</b><p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#585E5A">One service to start, more only when you need them</p></div></li>
<li style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:20px;padding:20px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #DED5C6"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:26px;color:#0F4C45">tune</span><div><b style="font-size:18px">Customization</b><p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#585E5A">Anything beyond the standard service</p></div></li>
<li style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:20px;padding:20px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #DED5C6"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:26px;color:#0F4C45">monitoring</span><div><b style="font-size:18px">Usage volume</b><p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.5;color:#585E5A">Billed at actual provider cost</p></div></li>
</ol>
</div>
</section>

<section aria-labelledby="faq-h" style="background:#EAF0F8;padding:clamp(48px,5.5vw,80px) 0">
<div style="max-width:1296px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 clamp(24px,4vw,48px);display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,340px),1fr));gap:clamp(32px,5vw,64px);align-items:start">
<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px"><h2 id="faq-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(28px,3vw,36px);line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-0.02em">Pricing questions</h2><a href="/faq?topic=pricing" style="font-weight:600;font-size:16px">See all questions →</a></div>
<div class="faq-span" style="border-bottom:1px solid #DED5C6">
<details open="" style="border-top:1px solid #DED5C6"><summary class="x1" style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;padding:24px 0;font-weight:600;font-size:clamp(17px,1.5vw,19px);line-height:1.4">Is there a setup fee?<span class="hm-plus ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:26px;color:#0F4C45;transition:transform .15s">add</span></summary><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633;padding:0 0 24px;max-width:64ch">No setup fee for standard services. A setup fee applies only when customization is required.</p></details>
<details style="border-top:1px solid #DED5C6"><summary class="x2" style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;padding:24px 0;font-weight:600;font-size:clamp(17px,1.5vw,19px);line-height:1.4">Is there a long-term contract?<span class="hm-plus ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:26px;color:#0F4C45;transition:transform .15s">add</span></summary><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633;padding:0 0 24px;max-width:64ch">No. Plans are month-to-month, and you can leave with 30 days' written notice.</p></details>
<details style="border-top:1px solid #DED5C6"><summary class="x3" style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;padding:24px 0;font-weight:600;font-size:clamp(17px,1.5vw,19px);line-height:1.4">How is usage billed?<span class="hm-plus ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:26px;color:#0F4C45;transition:transform .15s">add</span></summary><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633;padding:0 0 24px;max-width:64ch">Voice minutes, SMS and AI processing are billed separately at actual provider cost, with no markup.</p></details>
<details style="border-top:1px solid #DED5C6"><summary class="x4" style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;padding:24px 0;font-weight:600;font-size:clamp(17px,1.5vw,19px);line-height:1.4">What does the free website include?<span class="hm-plus ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:26px;color:#0F4C45;transition:transform .15s">add</span></summary><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633;padding:0 0 24px;max-width:64ch">When you subscribe to at least one AI service, you get a static website of up to 5 pages with one revision round, and you keep it if you leave. Free Website Terms apply.</p></details>
<details style="border-top:1px solid #DED5C6"><summary class="x5" style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;padding:24px 0;font-weight:600;font-size:clamp(17px,1.5vw,19px);line-height:1.4">Who owns my website, domain and data?<span class="hm-plus ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:26px;color:#0F4C45;transition:transform .15s">add</span></summary><p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633;padding:0 0 24px;max-width:64ch">You do. You own your domain, hosting, website content and data.</p></details>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section aria-labelledby="cta-h" style="padding:clamp(48px,5.5vw,80px) 0">
<div style="max-width:1296px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 clamp(24px,4vw,48px)">
<div style="background:#0F4C45;color:#FAF7F2;border-radius:24px;padding:clamp(28px,6vw,80px);display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,360px),1fr));gap:32px;align-items:center">
<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px"><h2 id="cta-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(30px,3.6vw,44px);line-height:1.12;letter-spacing:-0.025em;text-wrap:balance">Get a quote on a discovery call</h2><p style="font-size:clamp(17px,1.5vw,20px);line-height:1.6;color:#DCE7E4;max-width:48ch">Tell us what you want to solve. We'll suggest one right-sized starting point and price it for you.</p></div>
<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:12px;width:fit-content"><a class="x6" href="/book-a-discovery-call" style="display:inline-flex;white-space:nowrap;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;height:56px;padding:0 32px;border-radius:999px;background:#FAF7F2;color:#0F4C45;font-weight:600;font-size:17px;text-decoration:none">Book a Discovery Call<span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:20px">arrow_forward</span></a><span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-size:15px;color:#DCE7E4"><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:18px;color:#DCE7E4">schedule</span>A 15-minute call</span></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

</Base>

<style>
.x1:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #1D6B60 !important;outline-offset:2px !important}
.x2:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #1D6B60 !important;outline-offset:2px !important}
.x3:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #1D6B60 !important;outline-offset:2px !important}
.x4:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #1D6B60 !important;outline-offset:2px !important}
.x5:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #1D6B60 !important;outline-offset:2px !important}
